# docs/event_semantics.md section 3, docs/instr_candidate_clang.md).  Build: plan/C1_build_manifest.md, post-fix CF
# 833fdbb + BP b051eb0 in the cFS bundle candidate 1df262a (cFE 6cccb3f, OSAL f34759d, PSP bd4a2ea).  Paths are
# those of the C1 source view (cf/, bp/, cfe/, osal/); every ref is a line at the revision of its source.
# The meaning of each site is that of the F0 plan kairos/profiles/c1-bp-b051eb0/observe/sites-cf833fdbb.kzp; a
# label is reused only where the point is the same (a function's entry or return, a call's before or after).
# Values are what the instruction used (an argument or a return value) or, for out<k>, the pointee read by the
# same thread right after the return.  Not a research condition; the sites are the plan of a pilot comparison.
kzs-sites 1
